    "detailed_description": "Welcome to a bone-chilling horror experience set a world inspired by the iconic Steamboat Willie cartoon and Slender: the eight pages. You are a daring cargo collector, navigating through an eerie forest, collecting valuable cargo while desperately avoiding the nightmarish duo, Mickey and Minnie.<br><br>Once beloved characters, Mickey and Minnie have transformed into strange entities, their hollow eyes and eerie smiles haunting your every move.<br><br><strong>Your objective is simple:</strong> Collect valuable cargo scattered throughout the forest and return them to the dock inside a timeframe, while trying to not get caught.<br><br><strong>Be aware!</strong><br>The game uses you microphone, so keep quiet and everything <i>should</i> be alright.<br><br><i>The base game was made as a small project for fun in about a week, with further updates added afterwards to improve on the gameplay.</i>",
